{"1465470":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"The Crust","steam_appid":1465470,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4627820,2293920],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1.0 OUT NOW — full campaign with multiple endings, Planning Mode, Sandbox 2.0, global events, macOS<\/strong> <br><br>Mine resources and automate their production processes<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine lunar resources, craft processing machinery, and power up your base with satellites and batteries. Unlock scientific advancements across three research trees to enhance your technological capabilities.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1465470\/extras\/e40b4b161a814ec4777e4f2834e1ee68.poster.avif?t=1791564122\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1465470\/extras\/e40b4b161a814ec4777e4f2834e1ee68.webm?t=1791564122\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1465470\/extras\/e40b4b161a814ec4777e4f2834e1ee68.mp4?t=1791564122\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Automate resources with conveyor belts and drones.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamline your resource management as you deploy conveyor belts and drones for seamless automation<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on lunar expeditions to unearth the moon's hidden secrets, deploying your rover to various locations and delving into the mysteries of humanity's newfound lunar habitat.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.c